<title>NETHERLANDS: Dutch Jan producer prices rise 2.9 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Dutch Jan producer prices rise 2.9 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>VOORBURG, Netherlands 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Dutch producer price index (PPI) for manufactured goods rose a provisional 0.5 percent in January from December, giving a 2.9 percent rise year-on-year, the Central Bureau of Statistics (CBS) said on Monday.  </p>
<p> DUTCH PRODUCER PRICES	  Jan 97     Dec 96     Jan 96</p>
<p> Index (base 1990)		103.5	103.0	100.6</p>
<p> Month-on-month pct change	0.5	  0.3	  0.3</p>
<p> Year-on-year pct change	  2.9	  2.7	 -0.4</p>
<p> Subindex domestic prices     106.9	106.5	104.9</p>
<p> yr/yr pct change		   1.9	  2.0	  1.1</p>
<p> Subindex export prices	 100.9	100.3	 97.3</p>
<p> yr/yr pct change		   3.7	  3.2	 -1.5</p>
</text>
